label qst_DamzelDizzt_2_afterAction:
    $ LocSet("mc_house_bedroom")
    $ LocFlush()
    show mc at left
    show markus at right_f
    show nijah at center_f
    with dissolve
    'Back in my room, Nijah took a few steps back away from us the second she could.'
    NIJAH 'You... Zat was...'
    MC @talk 'Nijah, you have to trust us.'
    NIJAH 'Are you... humans?'
    'Me and Markus shared a uncomfortable look, slightly unsure now even amongst ourselves.'
    MARKUS 'Yes... Well... {i}Sort of.{/i}'
    NIJAH '...'
    NIJAH @sad 'Zis is quite a lot to take in.'
    'Nijah rubbed nervously at her brow, feeling a little lightheaded with everything she just saw.'
    'Nijah stepped forward, prodding at my chest with her finger.'
    MC @talk 'Uh, do you mind?'
    NIJAH '...'
    NIJAH 'It was like metal... But stronger..'
    'I reached out to gently grab her hand, snapping her out of what ever trance she had put herself in.'
    MC @talk 'Nijah...'
    NIJAH 'You... You can change into...'
    NIJAH '{i}That?{/i}'
    MC @talk '... Yes... We can change into those things.'
    'Nijah stared blankly ahead for a few moments before taking a deep sigh, and just like that, she reverted back to her old self again.'
    NIJAH '... I zee.'
    'Me and Markus curiously looked at each other before looking back at her.'
    MC @talk '... You do?'
    'Nijah smiled sheepishly, still trembling slightly as she spoke, but I could hear her heart beginning to settle.'
    NIJAH 'Your secret is safe with me.'
    NIJAH 'I owe you much...'
    "I turned to Markus who gave me a look of ‘Is she going to actually keep this quiet or not?’"
    MC @talk 'Markus, thank you for helping me.'
    MARKUS 'Well, I was hardly going to just let you get yourself killed, was I?'
    MC @talk 'Still...'
    'Nijah piped up.'
    NIJAH 'Thank you... both.'
    'Markus rolled his eyes and smiled.'
    MARKUS 'Well, just let me know if there’s any more trouble...'
    MARKUS 'Goodnight, both.'
    'With that, Markus nodded towards me as he left.'
    hide markus with easeoutright
    'When the door closed behind him, I turned to Nijah who nervously took a small step forward.'
    NIJAH 'You were afraid to tell me... Why?'
    MC @talk 'I was afraid you might run away if you saw me like that, that you might—'
    'Nijah suddenly cupped my face and pulled me in for a kiss much to my bewilderment.'
    NIJAH 'You... You did much to help.'
    NIJAH 'Keep no secrets from me... I care not for what you are.'
    NIJAH '{i}Because of who you are...{/i}'
    hide nijah
    scene black
    with dissolve
    "We have spent some time together, and I finally felt calming down after the night's events."
    "I walked Nijah to her home, which turned out to be not that far from mine."
    $ LocSet("novaras_dist_house")
    $ LocFlush()
    "Saying our goodbyes, Nijah gave me a warm embrace as she disappeared inside her house."
    BLACK "IT WAS A GOOD HUNT, HOST."
    return
